Subject: [PATCH 1/3] net: ethernet: ti: add CM-T43 PHY initialization

Initialize the CM-T43 PHY reference clock and reset lines before MDIO bus registration when requested by the board device tree. Keep the board-specific sequence in a separate, configuration-gated helper.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Valentin Raevsky <valentin@compulab.co.il>
